  fhir:language [ fhir:v "en"] ; # 
  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "generated" ] ;
     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: TestPlan ips-creator-tests</b></p><a name=\"ips-creator-tests\"> </a><a name=\"hcips-creator-tests\"> </a><p><b>Scopes</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Reference</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/ips/2.0.1/ActorDefinition-Creator.html\">Creator (IPS)</a></td><td>The IPS Creator actor — a system which produces, assembles or creates an IPS document — is the system under test.</td></tr></table><p><b>1 Suite: The document as a whole conforms</b></p><p>Rule: The document as a whole conforms — the scenarios grouped under it in the feature file.</p><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>ips-creator.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-000 The exported document is a valid IPS Bundle</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>2 Suite: The document: Bundle and Composition</b></p><p>Rule: The document: Bundle and Composition — the scenarios grouped under it in the feature file.</p><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>ips-creator.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-001 Bundle (IPS) — the Creator populates identifier, timestamp, entry:composition</td><td>Covers Bundle-uv-ips: Bundle.identifier, Bundle.timestamp, Bundle.entry:composition.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-002 Composition (IPS) — the Creator populates status, type, subject, subject.reference and more; 23 elements when known</td><td>Covers Composition-uv-ips: Composition.meta.profile, Composition.text, Composition.identifier, Composition.status, Composition.type, Composition.subject, Composition.subject.reference, Composition.date, Composition.author, Composition.title, Composition.attester, Composition.attester.mode, Composition.attester.time, Composition.attester.party, Composition.custodian, Composition.event:careProvisioningEvent, Composition.event:careProvisioningEvent.code, Composition.event:careProvisioningEvent.period, Composition.section.title, Composition.section.text, Composition.section:sectionProblems, Composition.section:sectionProblems.title, Composition.section:sectionProblems.text, Composition.section:sectionProblems.entry:problem, Composition.section:sectionProblems.emptyReason, Composition.section:sectionAllergies, Composition.section:sectionAllergies.title, Composition.section:sectionAllergies.text, Composition.section:sectionAllergies.entry:allergyOrIntolerance, Composition.section:sectionAllergies.emptyReason, Composition.section:sectionMedications, Composition.section:sectionMedications.title, Composition.section:sectionMedications.text, Composition.section:sectionMedications.entry:medicationStatementOrRequest, Composition.section:sectionMedications.emptyReason, Composition.section:sectionImmunizations, Composition.section:sectionImmunizations.title, Composition.section:sectionImmunizations.text, Composition.section:sectionImmunizations.entry:immunization, Composition.section:sectionResults, Composition.section:sectionResults.title, Composition.section:sectionResults.text, Composition.section:sectionResults.entry:results-observation-laboratory-pathology, Composition.section:sectionResults.entry:results-observation-radiology, Composition.section:sectionProceduresHx, Composition.section:sectionProceduresHx.title, Composition.section:sectionProceduresHx.text, Composition.section:sectionProceduresHx.entry:procedure, Composition.section:sectionMedicalDevices, Composition.section:sectionMedicalDevices.title, Composition.section:sectionMedicalDevices.text, Composition.section:sectionMedicalDevices.entry:deviceStatement, Composition.section:sectionAdvanceDirectives.title, Composition.section:sectionAdvanceDirectives.text, Composition.section:sectionAlerts.title, Composition.section:sectionAlerts.text, Composition.section:sectionFunctionalStatus.title, Composition.section:sectionFunctionalStatus.text, Composition.section:sectionPastProblems.title, Composition.section:sectionPastProblems.text, Composition.section:sectionPregnancyHx.title, Composition.section:sectionPregnancyHx.text, Composition.section:sectionPatientStory.title, Composition.section:sectionPatientStory.text, Composition.section:sectionPlanOfCare.title, Composition.section:sectionPlanOfCare.text, Composition.section:sectionSocialHistory.title, Composition.section:sectionSocialHistory.text, Composition.section:sectionVitalSigns.title, Composition.section:sectionVitalSigns.text.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>3 Suite: The people and organisations</b></p><p>Rule: The people and organisations — the scenarios grouped under it in the feature file.</p><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>ips-creator.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-003 Patient (IPS) — the Creator populates name; 10 elements when known</td><td>Covers Patient-uv-ips: Patient.identifier, Patient.name, Patient.name.use, Patient.name.text, Patient.name.family, Patient.name.given, Patient.telecom, Patient.gender, Patient.birthDate, Patient.address, Patient.generalPractitioner.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-004 Practitioner (IPS) — the Creator populates 5 elements when known</td><td>Covers Practitioner-uv-ips: Practitioner.name, Practitioner.name.family, Practitioner.name.given, Practitioner.telecom, Practitioner.address.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-005 PractitionerRole (IPS) — the Creator populates 1 element when known</td><td>Covers PractitionerRole-uv-ips: PractitionerRole.organization.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-006 Organization (IPS) — the Creator populates 3 elements when known</td><td>Covers Organization-uv-ips: Organization.name, Organization.telecom, Organization.address.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>4 Suite: The required sections: problems, allergies, medications</b></p><p>Rule: The required sections: problems, allergies, medications — the scenarios grouped under it in the feature file.</p><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>ips-creator.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-007 AllergyIntolerance (IPS) — the Creator populates 9 elements when known</td><td>Covers AllergyIntolerance-uv-ips: AllergyIntolerance.clinicalStatus, AllergyIntolerance.type, AllergyIntolerance.code, AllergyIntolerance.patient, AllergyIntolerance.patient.reference, AllergyIntolerance.onset[x], AllergyIntolerance.onset[x]:onsetDateTime, AllergyIntolerance.reaction, AllergyIntolerance.reaction.manifestation, AllergyIntolerance.reaction.severity.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-008 Condition (IPS) — the Creator populates 7 elements when known</td><td>Covers Condition-uv-ips: Condition.clinicalStatus, Condition.category, Condition.severity, Condition.code, Condition.subject, Condition.subject.reference, Condition.onset[x], Condition.onset[x]:onsetDateTime.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-009 Medication (IPS) — the Creator populates 5 elements when known</td><td>Covers Medication-uv-ips: Medication.code, Medication.form, Medication.ingredient, Medication.ingredient.item[x], Medication.ingredient.strength.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-010 MedicationRequest (IPS) — the Creator populates 6 elements when known</td><td>Covers MedicationRequest-uv-ips: MedicationRequest.medication[x], MedicationRequest.subject, MedicationRequest.subject.reference, MedicationRequest.dosageInstruction, MedicationRequest.dosageInstruction.text, MedicationRequest.dosageInstruction.timing.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-011 MedicationStatement (IPS) — the Creator populates 7 elements when known</td><td>Covers MedicationStatement-uv-ips: MedicationStatement.medication[x], MedicationStatement.subject, MedicationStatement.subject.reference, MedicationStatement.effective[x], MedicationStatement.effective[x]:effectiveDateTime, MedicationStatement.dosage, MedicationStatement.dosage.text, MedicationStatement.dosage.timing.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>5 Suite: The recommended sections: immunizations, results, procedures, devices</b></p><p>Rule: The recommended sections: immunizations, results, procedures, devices — the scenarios grouped under it in the feature file.</p><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>ips-creator.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-012 Immunization (IPS) — the Creator populates 5 elements when known</td><td>Covers Immunization-uv-ips: Immunization.status, Immunization.vaccineCode, Immunization.patient, Immunization.patient.reference, Immunization.occurrence[x], Immunization.occurrence[x]:occurrenceDateTime.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-013 Observation Results - Laboratory/Pathology (IPS) — the Creator populates 10 elements when known</td><td>Covers Observation-results-laboratory-pathology-uv-ips: Observation.category:laboratory, Observation.code, Observation.subject, Observation.subject.reference, Observation.effective[x], Observation.effective[x]:effectiveDateTime, Observation.performer, Observation.value[x]:valueString, Observation.value[x]:valueQuantity, Observation.value[x]:valueCodeableConcept, Observation.component.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-014 Observation Results - Radiology (IPS) — the Creator populates 8 elements when known</td><td>Covers Observation-results-radiology-uv-ips: Observation.category:radiology, Observation.code, Observation.subject, Observation.subject.reference, Observation.effective[x], Observation.effective[x]:effectiveDateTime, Observation.performer, Observation.value[x]:valueString, Observation.component.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-015 DiagnosticReport (IPS) — the Creator populates 6 elements when known</td><td>Covers DiagnosticReport-uv-ips: DiagnosticReport.code, DiagnosticReport.subject, DiagnosticReport.subject.reference, DiagnosticReport.effective[x], DiagnosticReport.effective[x]:effectiveDateTime, DiagnosticReport.performer, DiagnosticReport.result:observation-results.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-016 Specimen (IPS) — the Creator populates 3 elements when known</td><td>Covers Specimen-uv-ips: Specimen.type, Specimen.subject, Specimen.subject.reference.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-017 ImagingStudy (IPS) — the Creator populates 12 elements when known</td><td>Covers ImagingStudy-uv-ips: ImagingStudy.identifier, ImagingStudy.subject, ImagingStudy.subject.reference, ImagingStudy.started, ImagingStudy.procedureCode, ImagingStudy.reasonCode, ImagingStudy.series, ImagingStudy.series.uid, ImagingStudy.series.modality, ImagingStudy.series.instance, ImagingStudy.series.instance.uid, ImagingStudy.series.instance.sopClass.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-018 Procedure (IPS) — the Creator populates 4 elements when known</td><td>Covers Procedure-uv-ips: Procedure.code, Procedure.subject, Procedure.subject.reference, Procedure.performed[x], Procedure.performed[x]:performedDateTime.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-019 Device - Performer or Observer (IPS) — the Creator populates 3 elements when known</td><td>Covers Device-observer-uv-ips: Device.identifier, Device.manufacturer, Device.modelNumber.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-020 Device (IPS) — the Creator populates 1 element when known</td><td>Covers Device-uv-ips: Device.type.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-021 DeviceUseStatement (IPS) — the Creator populates 4 elements when known</td><td>Covers DeviceUseStatement-uv-ips: DeviceUseStatement.subject, DeviceUseStatement.subject.reference, DeviceUseStatement.timing[x], DeviceUseStatement.timing[x]:timingDateTime, DeviceUseStatement.device.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>6 Suite: The optional sections: alerts, pregnancy, social history</b></p><p>Rule: The optional sections: alerts, pregnancy, social history — the scenarios grouped under it in the feature file.</p><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>ips-creator.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-022 Flag - Alert (IPS) — the Creator populates 5 elements when known</td><td>Covers Flag-alert-uv-ips: Flag.extension:flag-priority, Flag.category, Flag.code, Flag.subject, Flag.subject.reference.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-023 Observation Pregnancy - Expected Delivery Date (IPS) — the Creator populates 5 elements when known</td><td>Covers Observation-pregnancy-edd-uv-ips: Observation.code, Observation.subject, Observation.subject.reference, Observation.effective[x], Observation.value[x]:valueDateTime.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-024 Observation Pregnancy - Outcome (IPS) — the Creator populates 5 elements when known</td><td>Covers Observation-pregnancy-outcome-uv-ips: Observation.code, Observation.subject, Observation.subject.reference, Observation.effective[x], Observation.value[x]:valueQuantity.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-025 Observation Pregnancy - Status (IPS) — the Creator populates 7 elements when known</td><td>Covers Observation-pregnancy-status-uv-ips: Observation.code, Observation.subject, Observation.subject.reference, Observation.effective[x], Observation.value[x]:valueCodeableConcept, Observation.hasMember, Observation.hasMember.reference.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>7 Suite: Data types used throughout</b></p><p>Rule: Data types used throughout — the scenarios grouped under it in the feature file.</p><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>ips-creator.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-026 Observation Social History - Tobacco Use (IPS) — the Creator populates 4 elements when known</td><td>Covers Observation-tobaccouse-uv-ips: Observation.code, Observation.subject, Observation.subject.reference, Observation.effective[x].</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-027 Observation Social History - Alcohol Use (IPS) — the Creator populates 4 elements when known</td><td>Covers Observation-alcoholuse-uv-ips: Observation.code, Observation.subject, Observation.subject.reference, Observation.effective[x].</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-028 Codeable Concept (IPS) — the Creator populates 2 elements when known</td><td>Covers CodeableConcept-uv-ips: CodeableConcept.coding, CodeableConcept.text.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-029 Coding with translations — the Creator populates 2 elements when known</td><td>Covers Coding-uv-ips: Coding.system, Coding.code.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>8 Suite: A patient with no known problems, allergies or medications still gets the required sections</b></p><p>Rule: A patient with no known problems, allergies or medications still gets the required sections — the scenarios grouped under it in the feature file.</p><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>ips-creator.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>ips-creator-900 Required sections carry an explicit no-information statement</td><td>Covers Composition-uv-ips: Composition.section:sectionProblems.emptyReason, Composition.section:sectionAllergies.emptyReason, Composition.section:sectionMedications.emptyReason.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
